.cmd-history-settings
    h3 Command history
    p.text-muted Configure per-connection history predictions and capture safety.

    .form-check.mb-3
        input#cmd-history-enabled.form-check-input(type='checkbox' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.enabled')
        label.form-check-label(for='cmd-history-enabled') Enable command history predictions

    .form-group
        label(for='cmd-history-presentation') Presentation
        select#cmd-history-presentation.form-control('[(ngModel)]'='draft.presentation' aria-describedby='cmd-history-presentation-help')
            option('*ngFor'='let mode of presentationModes' '[ngValue]'='mode') {{ mode }}
        small#cmd-history-presentation-help.form-text.text-muted Inline shows a suffix, list shows candidates, and hybrid starts inline.

    .settings-grid
        .form-group
            label(for='cmd-history-max-visible') Maximum visible candidates
            input#cmd-history-max-visible.form-control(type='number' min='1' max='20' step='1' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.maxVisible')
        .form-group
            label(for='cmd-history-min-query') Minimum query length
            input#cmd-history-min-query.form-control(type='number' min='1' max='20' step='1' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.minQueryLength')
        .form-group
            label(for='cmd-history-capacity') History capacity per connection
            input#cmd-history-capacity.form-control(type='number' min='1' max='100000' step='1' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.capacity')

    .form-check.mb-3
        input#cmd-history-case-sensitive.form-check-input(type='checkbox' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.caseSensitive')
        label.form-check-label(for='cmd-history-case-sensitive') Case-sensitive matching

    fieldset
        legend Score weights
        p.form-text.text-muted Values are normalized when saved and must have a positive total.
        .settings-grid
            .form-group
                label(for='cmd-history-weight-recency') Recency
                input#cmd-history-weight-recency.form-control(type='number' min='0' step='0.01' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.weights.recency')
            .form-group
                label(for='cmd-history-weight-frequency') Frequency
                input#cmd-history-weight-frequency.form-control(type='number' min='0' step='0.01' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.weights.frequency')
            .form-group
                label(for='cmd-history-weight-closeness') Match closeness
                input#cmd-history-weight-closeness.form-control(type='number' min='0' step='0.01' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.weights.matchCloseness')

    .form-group
        label(for='cmd-history-capture-mode') Capture mode
        select#cmd-history-capture-mode.form-control('[(ngModel)]'='draft.captureMode' aria-describedby='cmd-history-capture-warning')
            option('*ngFor'='let mode of captureModes' '[ngValue]'='mode') {{ mode }}
        .alert.alert-warning#cmd-history-capture-warning(role='alert') Permissive mode may save commands when visible shell echo cannot be verified. Use it only when you accept that risk.

    .form-check.mb-3
        input#cmd-history-sensitive-filtering.form-check-input(type='checkbox' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.sensitiveFiltering')
        label.form-check-label(for='cmd-history-sensitive-filtering') Filter commands that may contain sensitive values

    .form-group
        label(for='cmd-history-exclusions') Exclusion patterns
        textarea#cmd-history-exclusions.form-control(rows='5' '[(ngModel)]'='exclusionText' aria-describedby='cmd-history-exclusions-help')
        small#cmd-history-exclusions-help.form-text.text-muted One regular expression per line. Matching commands are not saved.

    fieldset
        legend Keyboard bindings
        p.form-text.text-muted Choose non-printable keys. Ctrl+C is never intercepted.
        .settings-grid
            .form-group('*ngFor'='let binding of [{ key: "previous", label: "Previous candidate" }, { key: "next", label: "Next candidate" }, { key: "accept", label: "Accept candidate" }, { key: "dismiss", label: "Dismiss candidates" }]')
                label('[for]'='"cmd-history-binding-" + binding.key') {{ binding.label }}
                select.form-control('[id]'='"cmd-history-binding-" + binding.key' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.bindings[binding.key]')
                    option('*ngFor'='let key of bindingOptionsFor(binding.key)' '[ngValue]'='key') {{ key }}

    .form-group
        label(for='cmd-history-data-root') Custom data directory (optional)
        input#cmd-history-data-root.form-control(type='text' '[(ngModel)]'='draft.dataRoot' aria-describedby='cmd-history-data-root-help')
        small#cmd-history-data-root-help.form-text.text-muted Use an absolute path inside your user home directory, or leave blank for the default. Restart Tabby after changing it.

    .alert.alert-danger('*ngIf'='validationError' role='alert') {{ validationError }}
    .alert.alert-info('*ngIf'='actionMessage' role='status' aria-live='polite') {{ actionMessage }}

    .settings-actions
        button.btn.btn-primary(type='button' '(click)'='save()' '[disabled]'='saving || clearing')
            span('*ngIf'='saving') Saving…
            span('*ngIf'='!saving') Save
        button.btn.btn-outline-danger(type='button' '(click)'='clearActiveConnection()' '[disabled]'='!canClearCurrentConnection || saving' aria-describedby='cmd-history-clear-help')
            span('*ngIf'='clearing') Clearing…
            span('*ngIf'='!clearing') Clear Current Connection
    small#cmd-history-clear-help.form-text.text-muted Clears history only for the focused terminal connection after confirmation.
